mestamp": "2026-04-17T16:51:47Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "2. In one of the most audacious moments in diplomatic history, X was the Indian Ambassador to the Soviet Union. At the time, Joseph Stalin was one of the most feared men on the planet and avoided meeting X for 6 months. During their final meeting in 1952, X patted Stalin on the cheek and back (a gesture of affection normally unthinkable with the dictator).\nHe told Stalin the story of Emperor Ashoka, who gave up violence after the Kalinga war. X then looked him in the eye and said, \"God only knows what will become of you.\" Surprisingly, Stalin wasn't angry. He reportedly held X’s hand and said, \"I am sad you are leaving. I have not long to live.\" Stalin died less than a year later. Id X who was reportedly nominated for the Nobel for literature (16) and Peace (11) a total of 27 times. Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:52:01Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "S radhakrishnan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:52:01Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Radhakrishnan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:52:01Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "radhakrishnan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:52:03Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "s", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:52:06Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "sarvepalli", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:52:16Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Oh wow", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:52:23Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text":